{"reviews":[{"id":"B01N2VTZCC-0","r":3.0,"t":"Nice but closure was not as expected","x":"Cape was reasonably priced.  Fabric was as expected however the neck is elasticized with some type of hook that I'm actually not sure how to fasten.  The images in product description show the product to have a snap closure like capes I've seen in salons.  The cape will suit my needs but I was expecting a better quality to the closure.","h":27,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01N2VTZCC-1","r":3.0,"t":"NOT AS ADVERTISED","x":"Neck of cape does not have snaps as shown in pictures but instead is a metal hook with elastic. This makes it so it is not adjustable to fit all ages as was advertised, this product is NOT AS ADVERTISED! Edit: After placing this 1 star review and complaining a new salon gown was sent to me without an additional charge with the snaps as advertised so I am changing the review to 3 star due to inconvenience but they did correct their mistake at least, so thank you.","h":17,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01N2VTZCC-2","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Works great and looks great , and cheap !!","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B01N2VTZCC-3","r":1.0,"t":"Not good!","x":"Too Thin! This was a very inexpensive cape, so I thought I\u2019d give it a try. But I guess you get what you pay for... this cape is paper thin! I feel like if someone had wet hair and it water dropped on the cape that it would go right through the cape and get your client wet. I should have returned it, but I didn\u2019t","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B01N2VTZCC-4","r":1.0,"t":"Don\u2019t waste your time & money on this product!","x":"These capes are waste of money! They are very thin and cheaply made. I ordered two and one of them has a tear. I would be afraid to wash them, they most likely just fall apart. Very disappointing. I\u2019m in process of returning them!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2018"},{"id":"B01N2VTZCC-5","r":5.0,"t":"Good barber cape and kinda cute","x":"Works well and stays clean. It is made of polyester which I like and the size is nice. It fits around the neck with many snaps so you can pick your size. The length is good as well. It reached down over the knees when sitting.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B01N2VTZCC-6","r":2.0,"t":"U get what u pay for. I had this ...","x":"U get what u pay for. I had this cape less than a week and the snaps have already broke. Not worth the hassle","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01N2VTZCC-7","r":5.0,"t":"Should have bought this sooner.","x":"I now feel like a professional with this light weight, very comfortable cape. The kids love not having to hold a towel or old shower curtain that all the hair sticks to. This product does everything thing it says it does with snaps in the back, breathable, size adjustable and hair slides right off. A must for anyone cutting hair, do it yourselfers like me or professionals.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B01N2VTZCC-8","r":5.0,"t":"I like the elastic better","x":"I like the elastic better, the elastic is for all sizes!! You guys just are not fimiliar with the new cape styles!! Once you learn how to use the elastic with hooks you will find out how much better it is than the buttons. I am a barber and hair never gets into the neck area cuz I, unlike all you complainers know how to use the neck fastener.","h":2,"v":0,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01N2VTZCC-9","r":2.0,"t":"... for closure purposes are not positioned properly rendering them useless.","x":"There are no snaps at the neck as were noted in the pictures and the hooks that are used for closure purposes are not positioned properly rendering them useless.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2017"},{"id":"B01N2VTZCC-10","r":1.0,"t":"I like the design and feel of the item","x":"I like the design and feel of the item, however the buttons to close it around someone's neck didn't snap shut.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01N2VTZCC-11","r":4.0,"t":"Vovotrade Pro Cutting Hair Waterproof Cloth...","x":"Better than the garbage bag I used when I last cut my husband's hair for him! I like this product.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B01N2VTZCC-12","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Love the cape currently in Beauty School use it everyday it was as I expected","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01N2VTZCC-13","r":1.0,"t":"Low quality","x":"The buttons went out from the first time.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B01N2VTZCC-14","r":5.0,"t":"Love!","x":"Wife review- purchased and bought a second one. Accidentally dropped black hair-color on it, used hairspray and it came out. It washes well, hang dry. Snaps are great for getting close to the neck and not having hair go through like Velcro closures. Planning on buying another one to make cafe curtains for the shop.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B01N2VTZCC-15","r":1.0,"t":"Not same ITEMS","x":"Dislike it cause it is not the same picture they post on amazon. Quality is mot good In the picture : Top is mine ( same picture they post) Bottom is their( differ than what they are posting)","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B01N2VTZCC-16","r":5.0,"t":"Wonderful cape","x":"This cape is far better than I expected. Great fabric not stiff  beautiful print for male or female clients. Nice adjustable neck with many snaps giving unlimited sizing.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2017"},{"id":"B01N2VTZCC-17","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent quality and very breathable for the clients","x":"Excellent quality and very breathable for the clients, so they dont get hot like other capes. Neck is adjustable for kids to adult males.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B01N2VTZCC-18","r":4.0,"t":"Good Product, long ship time though","x":"Very nice for home hair cutting, very long ship time though, forgot I ordered it by the time I got it.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2017"},{"id":"B01N2VTZCC-19","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Great service and delivery time, would recommend to all it is an excellent product.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B01N2VTZCC-20","r":5.0,"t":"La calidad y el precio","x":"Es muy lijera,practica y suave. Soy estilista y me encanta.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B01N2VTZCC-21","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Am a barber and this cape work wonderfully for me, love it","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01N2VTZCC-22","r":2.0,"t":"odd shape opening way to big for childer.","x":"Odd shape and opening way to big for a child.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B01N2VTZCC-23","r":4.0,"t":"I\u2019d say- pretty good.","x":"Still in good shape.  Fairly cheaply made but we wash this cape after every use and it\u2019s been going strong for almost a year.  The cape may have lost a snap but that\u2019s not too bad.  It probably cost 1/3 of the price of my other capes and the are in the same condition so I\u2019d call it a win.  It\u2019s pretty thin but for a men\u2019s haircut it\u2019s perfect.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B01N2VTZCC-24","r":2.0,"t":"NOT water proof! It is fine for cutting hair with its thin lightweight sheen material","x":"This is NOT a water proof hairstyling drape. It is fine for cutting hair with its thin lightweight sheen material. If you use it with water or hair coloring it will go through the drape. Love the design on the material, but bought this because it said water proof.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Several reviewers report the neck closure does not match the pictured snaps, arriving instead with an elastic and hook or metal hook that some find hard to fasten or not adjustable.","cites":[1,2,10]},{"text":"Some reviewers find the material too thin and cheaply made, with concerns about tearing or washing durability.","cites":[4,5]},{"text":"A number of reviewers praise the cape as good value, working well and looking good for the price.","cites":[3,12,13]},{"text":"Some reviewers report the snaps or buttons broke or failed to close properly.","cites":[7,11,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers appreciate the snap closure, adjustable fit, and easy-clean, hair-shedding material.","cites":[6,8,15]}]},"qa":[]}